  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers 2 and 3:\n\nOption 1) 5 - 3 ÷ 1 × 2 + 7 = 6 ⇒ 5 - 2 ÷ 1 × 3 + 7 = 6\n\n5 - __**2 ÷ 1**__ × 3 + 7 = 6\n\n5 - __**2 × 3**__ + 7 = 6\n\n__**5 + 7**__ - 6 = 6\n\n__**12 - 6**__ = 6\n\n6 = 6 (LHS = RHS)\n\nOption 2) 7 + 8 - 6 ÷ 2 × 3 = 11 ⇒ 7 + 8 - 6 ÷ 3 × 2 = 11\n\n7 + 8 - __**6 ÷ 3**__ × 2 = 11\n\n7 + 8 - __**2 × 2**__ = 11\n\n__**7 + 8**__ - 4 = 11\n\n__**15 - 4**__ = 11\n\n11 = 11 (LHS = RHS)\n\n**Option 3) 8 + 7 × 3 - 6 ÷ 2 = 22 ⇒ 8 + 7 × 2 - 6 ÷ 3 = 22**\n\n8 + 7 × 2 - __**6 ÷ 3**__ = 22\n\n8 + __**7 × 2**__ - 2 = 22\n\n__**8 + 14**__ - 2 = 22\n\n__**22 - 2**__ = 22\n\n**20 ≠ 22 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nOption 4) 7 × 3 - 9 ÷ 2 + 4 = 15 ⇒ 7 × 2 - 9 ÷ 3 + 4 = 15\n\n7 × 2 - __**9 ÷ 3**__ + 4 = 15\n\n__**7 × 2**__ - 3 + 4 = 15\n\n__**14 + 4**__ - 3 = 15\n\n18 - 3 = 15\n\n15 = 15 (LHS = RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
